#: templates/datapages/lands.html
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Each land from %(low)s to %(high)s makes a Commander deck about %(gain)s "
"points more likely to have four lands on turn 4, and costs it about %(cost)s"
" spells seen by turn %(turns)s. There is no corner where lands stop helping:"
" each one buys and costs about as much as the one before. The usual 35 to 38"
" is a trade between land drops and spells, not a threshold."
msgstr ""
"土地を%(low)s枚から%(high)s枚まで1枚増やすごとに、統率者デッキが4ターン目に土地4枚を揃える確率は約%(gain)sポイント上がり、%(turns)sターン目までに見る呪文は約%(cost)s枚減ります。土地が役に立たなくなる境目はありません。1枚ごとの得と損は、前の1枚とほぼ同じです。よく言われる35〜38枚は、土地のセットと呪文の間の取引であり、境界線ではありません。"

#: templates/datapages/lands.html
#, python-format
msgid ""
"We rebuilt %(decks)s precon with every land count from %(low)s to %(high)s "
"and played each version %(games)s times. The same deck at eight land counts "
"shows what a land does, which comparing different decks cannot."
msgid_plural ""
"We rebuilt %(decks)s precons with every land count from %(low)s to %(high)s "
"and played each version %(games)s times. The same deck at eight land counts "
"shows what a land does, which comparing different decks cannot."
msgstr[0] ""
"構築済みデッキ%(decks)s個を、土地%(low)s枚から%(high)s枚までのすべての枚数で組み直し、それぞれ%(games)s回プレイしました。同じデッキを8通りの土地の枚数で比べると、土地1枚の働きがわかります。異なるデッキどうしの比較ではわかりません。"

